<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" %><%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core" %><c:set var="pageTitle" value="About"/><!doctype html><html><head><%@ include file="WEB-INF/views/common/head.jspf" %></head><body><nav class="navbar navbar-dark public-nav"><div class="container"><a class="navbar-brand" href="./"><i class="fa-solid fa-qrcode me-2 text-warning"></i>QRID Campus</a><a class="btn btn-warning" href="login">Portal Login</a></div></nav><main><section class="py-5 bg-brand text-white"><div class="container py-5"><h1 class="display-4 fw-bold">A safer, simpler campus identity layer.</h1><p class="lead text-white-50 col-lg-8">QRID Campus replaces slow visual inspection and difficult-to-revoke plastic cards with controlled digital issuance and immediate status verification.</p></div></section><section class="section-space"><div class="container"><div class="row g-5"><div class="col-lg-7"><h2 class="fw-bold">Designed around real institutional workflows</h2><p class="text-secondary">The system separates responsibilities among administrators, security officers, and department staff. Every important action is checked on the server and added to the audit trail.</p><p class="text-secondary">A QR token never contains private profile fields. It points to a controlled verification workflow, allowing a lost identity to be suspended or regenerated without changing the person's academic record.</p></div><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="panel p-4"><h5><i class="fa-solid fa-lock text-brand me-2"></i>Security foundations</h5><ul class="text-secondary mt-3"><li>BCrypt password hashing</li><li>Role-based route authorization</li><li>Prepared SQL statements</li><li>Validated photo and CSV uploads</li><li>Versioned, revocable QR tokens</li><li>Scan and audit logs</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="public-footer"><div class="container">QRID Campus | Educational Identity Management</div></footer><%@ include file="WEB-INF/views/common/scripts.jspf" %></body></html>
